systems to know the difference between, say, a stray, windblown plastic bag and a pedestrian). *Fortune* spoke to more 
than a dozen people close to Wang, including current and former Scale AI employees, investors, acquaintances, and 
competitors, to trace how the 28-year-old MIT dropout built the business at the center of one of the richest deals in 
the AI boom, and to understand why Meta is betting so much on it.", "score": 0.08486382, "raw_content": "Oops, something
