The Ministry of Industry and Information Technology (MIIT) set up the Standardization Committee for Humanoid Robots to 
oversee rule-setting.20 Provincial and municipal governments are pursuing different approaches, too: Shanghai’s “Action 
Plan for the Development of the Embodied Intelligence Industry 2025-2028,” for example,  targets “algorithmic 
breakthroughs” in EAI.21 The central leadership has made EAI a national priority, listing it in 2025 as a target for 
