Dynamics) | Boston Dynamics operates as a Hyundai subsidiary; Atlas Electric transitioned to electric actuation in 2024 
with pilot deployments in 2025-2026 |\n\n### Tesla (TSLA)\n\nTesla is the only U.S.-listed company with a humanoid robot
