comments\n### Transcript:\nHumanoid robots are rapidly advancing at a rate quicker than expected. In this video, I will 
do a deep dive on the top humanoid robots that exist in 2025. Engine AI is a cuttingedge robotics company based in 
Shenzhen, China that has quickly gained recognition in the global robotics industry since its founding in October 2023. 
The company specializes in developing humanoid robots with lielike movement capabilities, setting a new benchmark for 
realism and functionality in robotics technology. Among its creations, Engine AI's SE01 humanoid robot stands out for 
its remarkably humanlike gate and advanced motion control. Achieved through the use of NVIDIA's Isaac Gym, a virtual 
environment that enables sophisticated AI training, this platform allows the robot to simulate and refine movements 
before implementing them in the physical world, resulting in fluid and natural locomotion that closely mimics human 
behavior. Engine AI's team composed of 36 researchers from prestigious institutions such as UC Berkeley has focused on 
addressing long-standing challenges in robotics such as stiff or awkward movement patterns by combining deep 
reinforcement learning with imitation learning based on actual human motion. They have created robots capable of 
performing complex tasks with agility and precision. For example, the SE01 robot can squat, run, do push-ups, and even 
