Agility, which builds a robot called Digit, the first humanoid-focused company to go public in the US.\n\nThe startup, 
which spun out of Oregon State University in 2015, plans to merge with Churchill Capital Corp XI, a [special-purpose 
acquisition company (SPAC)](https://www.businessinsider.com/personal-finance/investing/what-is-a-spac) led by former 
